msgid "ReliefClipboard 剪贴板管理"
msgstr "ReliefClipboard Clipboard Management"

msgid ""
"桌面会话自动启动剪贴板管理器。通过应用菜单、托盘图标或 ``Super+V`` 打开 "
"历史窗口，输入关键字搜索，选择条目后点击“复制到剪贴板”，再切回目标程序粘贴。 "
"关闭历史窗口后，后台服务继续运行。托盘右键菜单可以显示窗口、暂停记录、清空或退出。"
msgstr ""
"The desktop session starts the clipboard manager automatically. Open history"
" from the applications menu, tray icon, or ``Super+V``, search by keyword, "
"select an entry, click Copy to Clipboard, then switch back to the target "
"application to paste. Closing history leaves the background service running."
" The tray context menu can show the window, pause recording, clear history, "
"or exit."

msgid "支持范围"
msgstr "Supported Features"

msgid ""
"剪贴板使用 X11 ``CLIPBOARD`` selection，鼠标选区 ``PRIMARY`` 独立保留。 支持 UTF-8 文本、图片及文件 "
"URI，同时保留来源提供的其他字节格式。 来源存活时保留其所有权，来源退出后接管已获取的数据。 内置 FLTK 应用在正常退出时使用 "
"``CLIPBOARD_MANAGER/SAVE_TARGETS`` 交接。 ICCCM "
"``TARGETS``、``TIMESTAMP``、``MULTIPLE`` 和 ``INCR`` 用于格式协商及大数据传输。"
msgstr ""
"The clipboard uses the X11 ``CLIPBOARD`` selection, keeping mouse selection "
"``PRIMARY`` independent. It supports UTF-8 text, images, and file URIs, "
"while retaining other byte formats offered by the source. The source keeps "
"ownership while alive; the manager takes over acquired data after the source"
" exits. Built-in FLTK applications hand over with "
"``CLIPBOARD_MANAGER/SAVE_TARGETS`` on normal exit. ICCCM ``TARGETS``, "
"``TIMESTAMP``, ``MULTIPLE``, and ``INCR`` handle format negotiation and "
"large transfers."

msgid ""
"Fileman 使用 ``text/uri-list``、GNOME 文件剪切/复制格式和 KDE 剪切标记，支持 独立实例之间的复制粘贴。URI "
"按文件路径的实际字节编码，中文、空格、换行与百分号 均可保留。远程 URI 不作为本地路径执行。剪切成功的条目从原剪贴板列表移除， "
"部分失败保留未移动条目，且仅在剪贴板内容仍匹配原操作时更新。"
msgstr ""
"Fileman uses ``text/uri-list``, GNOME file cut/copy formats, and KDE cut "
"markers, supporting copy/paste between independent instances. URIs encode "
"the actual bytes of file paths, preserving Chinese characters, spaces, "
"newlines, and percent signs. Remote URIs are not executed as local paths. "
"Successfully cut entries are removed from the original clipboard list, while"
" partial failures retain unmoved entries; updates occur only if the "
"clipboard still matches the original operation."

msgid ""
"Paint 支持图片复制和粘贴，现有画布有修改时先询问是否替换。图片粘贴仍遵循 Paint "
"本身的画布容量。历史窗口提供文本和可解码图片预览，预览容量独立于传输容量。"
msgstr ""
"Paint supports image copy/paste and asks before replacing a modified canvas."
" Image pasting still follows Paint's own canvas capacity. History previews "
"text and decodable images; preview limits are independent of transfer "
"limits."

msgid "历史与配置"
msgstr "History and Configuration"

msgid ""
"默认跨登录保存历史，设置窗口可关闭“退出登录后保留历史”。暂停记录会停止添加 历史条目，当前剪贴板的来源退出接管仍可使用。清空历史同时清空当前剪贴板。"
msgstr ""
"History persists across logins by default; disable Keep History After Logout"
" in settings to turn this off. Pausing recording stops adding history "
"entries but still allows takeover of the current clipboard after its source "
"exits. Clearing history also clears the current clipboard."

msgid ""
"历史位于 ``$XDG_STATE_HOME/reliefclipboard/history``，默认 "
"``~/.local/state/reliefclipboard/history``。"
msgstr ""
"History is stored at ``$XDG_STATE_HOME/reliefclipboard/history``, defaulting"
" to ``~/.local/state/reliefclipboard/history``."

msgid ""
"配置位于 ``$XDG_CONFIG_HOME/reliefclipboard/settings.conf``，默认 "
"``~/.config/reliefclipboard/settings.conf``。``PersistHistory=1`` 启用保存， "
"``PersistHistory=0`` 关闭保存并移除磁盘历史。"
msgstr ""
"Configuration is at ``$XDG_CONFIG_HOME/reliefclipboard/settings.conf``, "
"defaulting to ``~/.config/reliefclipboard/settings.conf``. "
"``PersistHistory=1`` enables persistence; ``PersistHistory=0`` disables it "
"and removes disk history."

msgid ""
"私有目录权限为 ``0700``，文件权限为 ``0600``。写入通过子进程完成，以临时文件、 ``fsync`` "
"和原子重命名提交。解析失败不会把部分读取结果作为完整历史使用。"
msgstr ""
"Private directories use permissions ``0700`` and files ``0600``. Child "
"processes write using temporary files, ``fsync``, and atomic rename to "
"commit. Parsing failures never treat partially read data as complete "
"history."

msgid ""
"历史最多保存 100 条、128 MiB 数据，单条最多 64 MiB、64 种字节格式，容量满时 淘汰较旧条目。窗口预览文本最多显示前 4096 "
"字节，搜索检查完整文本。"
msgstr ""
"History retains up to 100 entries and 128 MiB of data, with at most 64 MiB "
"and 64 byte formats per entry; older entries are evicted when full. Text "
"previews show at most the first 4096 bytes, while searches inspect the full "
"text."

msgid "X11 资源句柄格式如 PIXMAP 不跨登录保存，图片通过字节格式传输。"
msgstr ""
"X11 resource-handle formats such as PIXMAP are not persisted across logins; "
"images are transferred as byte formats."

msgid "命令行"
msgstr "Command Line"

msgid ""
"``reliefclipboard --daemon`` 启动后台服务，``reliefclipboard --show`` 打开窗口。 每个 X11 "
"display 由标准 manager selection 保证一个管理器。"
msgstr ""
"``reliefclipboard --daemon`` starts the background service; "
"``reliefclipboard --show`` opens the window. Standard manager selection "
"ensures one manager per X11 display."

